<LegalLayout title="Privacy policy" description="HonorCart privacy policy."><h2>Privacy by restraint</h2><p>HonorCart is in pre-release development. This policy describes the intended data boundaries for the website, creator dashboard, and future browser extension. We will update it before collecting production extension telemetry.</p><h2>Website and account data</h2><p>When account features launch, we expect to collect an email address, display name, creator profile details, registered affiliate identifiers, and verification records. Authentication credentials will be handled by a dedicated authentication service and never stored in plaintext.</p><h2>Protected-referral events</h2><p>Future extension events are designed to include a random event ID, creator and identifier references, merchant and network configuration references, timestamps, protection reason, policy version, and optional checkout value. They are not designed to contain full URLs, coupon-field contents, payment details, or a shopper’s identity.</p><h2>Demo data</h2><p>All dashboard and monetary figures currently displayed are sample data. No live extension telemetry is connected.</p><h2>Retention and control</h2><p>Retention periods, deletion controls, subprocessors, and legally required regional disclosures will be finalized before public telemetry collection. Contact <a href="mailto:privacy@honorcart.com">privacy@honorcart.com</a> with questions.</p></LegalLayout>
